<title>TURKEY: BASKETBALL-EFES PILSEN STAY TOP.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EFES PILSEN STAY TOP.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Efes Pilsen of Turkey kept up the pressure in group D of the men's basketball EuroLeague on Thursday with a convincing 93-77 victory over Partizan Belgrade of Yugoslavia..</p>
<p>Efes took the initiative early on and ran out easy winners, with Petar Naumovski top-scoring with an excellent 30 points, followed by Vasili Karasev on 27. Efes stay top of their group with five wins from seven games, the same as France's Pau-Orthez who triumphed 69-61 in Sevilla on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
